om Villa in Al Ghadeer Phase 2 with Skyline Views in Al Ghadeer Phase 2, Abu Dhabi. View photos, specifications and contact the agent.', 1, 'manual', '2026-05-01 13:00:00', '2026-05-24 13:00:00');
