(159, '01K2F2DKG0BJ0Z7T6XRGPBTQN9', 'LF-2558', 14, 14, 41, 64, 105, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Newly Renovated 2 Bedroom Mansion in Capon on a Corner Plot', 'newly-renovated-2-bedroom-mansion-in-capon-on-a-corner-plot-159', 'Capon, Saint-Tropez', 'An exceptional opportunity in Capon, Saint-Tropez. This mansion extends to approximately 1522 sq ft of thoughtfully arranged accommodation, with generous ceiling heights, full-height glazing and a considered material palette throughout.  The principal reception opens directly onto the terrace, while the kitchen is fully fitted with integrated appliances. Bedrooms are all en suite, and the primary suite benefits from a dressing room and a private terrace.  Capon remains one of the most sought-after addresses in Saint-Tropez, with immediate access to the waterfront, international schools and the retail and dining destinations the district is known for. Viewing is strictly by appointment.', '/real-estate/for-sale/fr/saint-tropez/capon/newly-renovated-2-bedroom-mansion-in-capon-on-a-corner-plot-159', 80000000, 'EUR', 318728000.0, 'fixed', NULL, 52542.4, 50000312, '58 Umm Suqeim Road', NULL, 43.3047909, 6.6255792, 0, 'active', 'approved', NULL, '2026-03-29 00:00:00', '2026-11-07 09:00:00', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 'Leila Santos', '+971 4 676 9227', '+971 537771603', 'leila.santos@sovereign-estates.com', 1, 1, 1, 'https://cdn.livfinder.com/listings/newly-renovated-2-bedroom-mansion-in-capon-on-a-corner-plot-159/01.jpg', 'Newly Renovated 2 Bedroom Mansion in Capon on a Corner Plot — main image', 8, 2, 0, 0, 0, '{"listed_by": "professional", "viewing_notes": "By appointment only", "chiller": "included", "kitchen": "Boffi", "flooring": "Travertine", "balcony_count": 1}', 74, 453, 'Newly Renovated 2 Bedroom Mansion in Capon on a Corner Plot | Liv Finder', 'Newly Renovated 2 Bedroom Mansion in Capon on a Corner Plot in Capon, Saint-Tropez. View photos, specifications and contact the agent.', 1, 'manual', '2026-03-25 00:00