edroom Hotel Apartment in St. Regis Bal Harbour with Sea Views in St. Regis Bal Harbour, Miami. View photos, specifications and contact the agent.', 1, 'manual', '2025-11-07 11:00:00', '2025-11-25 11:00:00');
