-- Plain SQL. Edit it directly; there is no generator behind it.
-- Regenerate with:  python3 db/tools/build_demo_seed.py
--
-- Listings across all six asset classes, each with a row in its
-- class's detail table, real media, amenity tags and resolved contact
-- details.
-- 
-- Every listing carries contact_phone and contact_whatsapp. The audit
-- found the Call and WhatsApp buttons inert site-wide because "none of
-- the per-category mock detail-data fixtures give the agent/agency
-- object phone or whatsapp fields at all — there is nothing to wire up".
-- There is now.
-- 
-- All counter columns are left at their defaults; they are derived at the
-- end of the seed run. See 049_demo_finalise.sql.
-- =============================================================================

